oat"><label>Table 1.</label><caption><p>Chromatographic parameters for betaxolol enantiomers and the internal standard S-(&#x02013;)-atenolol.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Analyte</bold></th><th valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>R<sub>s</sub><sup><xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn1-aci-2006-013">a</xref></sup></bold></th><th valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>&#x003b1;<sup><xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn2-aci-2006-013">b</xref></sup></bold></th><th valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold><italic>K</italic><sup><xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn3-aci-2006-013">c</xref>,<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn4-aci-2006-013">d</xref></sup></bold></th><th valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>T<sub>R</sub> (min)<sup><xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn4-aci-2006-013">d</xref></sup></bold></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">S-betaxolol</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.83</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.12</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">6.62 &#x000b1; 0.02</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">11.36 &#x000b1; 0.03</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">R-betaxolol</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">6.98</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.69</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">7.46 &#x000b1; 0.04</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">12.62 &#x000b1; 0.05</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">S-(&#x02013;)-atenolol</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><sup><xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn5-aci-2006-013">e</xref></sup></td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><sup><xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn5-aci-2006-013">e</xref></sup></td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">12.61 &#x000b1; 0.01</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">20.29 &#x000b1; 0.02</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn1-aci-2006-013"><label><sup>a</sup></label><p><italic>R</italic><sub>s</sub> = (<italic>t</italic><sub>2</sub> &#x02013; <italic>t</italic><sub>1</sub>)/0.5(<italic>w</italic><sub>1</sub>+<italic>w</italic><sub>2</sub>)</p></fn><fn id="tfn2-aci-2006-013"><label><sup>b</sup></label><p>Separation factor, calculated as <italic>k</italic><sub>2</sub>/<italic>k</italic><sub>1</sub></p></fn><fn id="tfn3-aci-2006-013"><label><sup>c</sup></label><p>Capacity factor, calculated as <italic>T</italic><italic><sub>R</sub></italic> &#x02013; <italic>T</italic><sub>0</sub>/<italic>T</italic><sub>0</sub></p></fn><fn id="tfn4-aci-2006-013"><label><sup>d</sup></label><p>Mean &#x000b1; SD, n = 3</p></fn><fn id="tfn5-aci-2006-013"><label><sup>e</sup></label><p>Not calculated</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="t2-aci-2006-013" position="float"><label>Table 2.</label><caption><p>Validation parameters for the determination of betaxolol enantiomers using the proposed method.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Parameter</bold></th><th valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>S-betaxolol</bold></th><th valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>R-betaxolol</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Concentration range (ng/ml)</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">10&#x02013;500</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">10&#x02013;500</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Intercept (a)</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;0.002</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02212;0.003</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Slope (b)</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.005</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.005</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Correlation coefficient (r)</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.996</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.996</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">S<sub>y/x</sub></td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.034</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.036</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">S<sub>a</sub></td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.030</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.031</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">S<sub>b</sub></td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.0004</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.0005</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">LOD (ng/ml)<sup><xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tfn6-aci-2006-013">a</xref></sup></td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">LOQ (ng/ml)</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">10</td><td valign="top" align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">10</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn6-aci-2006-013"><label><sup>a</sup></label><p>S/N = 3</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="t3-aci-2006-013" position="float"><label>Table 3.</label><caption><p>Determination of betaxolol enantiomers in standard solutions by the proposed method.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><the